{"3390030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shinayu", "steam_appid": 3390030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinayu is the first game which combines a collectible fantasy trading card game with an intense 3D combat game. Obtain the control of your most favoured character cards and combine powerful magic spells in impeccable 3D fights. Immerse yourself in the world of Shinayu where five dimensions are connected by the Shinayu portal. Unique character races and environments exist in every dimension which clash against each other to fight for the precious resources.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinayu is the first game which combines a collectible fantasy trading card game with an intense 3D combat game. Obtain the control of your most favoured character cards and combine powerful magic spells in impeccable 3D fights. Immerse yourself in the world of Shinayu where five dimensions are connected by the Shinayu portal. Unique character races and environments exist in every dimension which clash against each other to fight for the precious resources.</p>", "short_description": "Shinayu is a brand-new game concept combining round-based strategy card game with mechanical based 3D combat game. The first game where cards can be played in two vastly different game modes. Enjoy the strategical card game and bring the cards alive in intense 3D arenas whenever characters clash.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390030/1b9adac94f7f54c2723f37edba0f6ee47cc67b41/header.jpg?t=1784664085", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390030/ec73f1a64b2070b06687cf98d42dbe2cbc9c1e41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784664085", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.stea